	"Description": "I mainly made these bags for my modded playthrough and was frustrated that their where slim to none item bags for some of my favorite mods so I rectified that.\n<br />   \uFEFF\n<br />Installation\n<br />   \uFEFF1. Unzip\n<br />   \uFEFF2. Drop Json files in\u00A0C:&#92;Program Files (x86)&#92;Steam&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Mods&#92;ItemBags&#92;assets&#92;Modded Bags or equivalent\u00A0\n<br />   \uFEFF3. Enjoy!!!\n<br />\n<br />Updating\n<br />   \uFEFFDrop files in the same location and select replace files, all items will transfer\n<br />\n<br />Available Bags (&amp; Locations)\n<br />   \uFEFFMount Vapius Bags\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFAnimal Products (Marnie)\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFCooking Bag (Gus)\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFCrops Bag (Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFFishing Bag (Willy)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFMining &amp; Artifacts Bag (Clint, Dwarf, &amp; Krobus)\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFSeeds and Saplings (Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFForage of Ferngill Bags\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFCoastal (Willy)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFFruits &amp; Nuts (Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFKombucha (Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFMushrooms (Pierre)\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFRoots (Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFWild Flowers (Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFWildFlour's Atelier\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFHot Barista (Gus)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFBrewer\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFConfections\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFCanner\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFCold Barista (Gus)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFFlorist\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFFrozen Confections\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFGourmand (Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFPickling\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFForage\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFEast Scarp Bag (Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFNever Ending Adventure and Circle of Thorns Bag (Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFRidgeside Bag (Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFAdventurer's Guild Expanded (Marlon)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFDwarven Expansion Bags\n<br />      \uFEFF\uFEFFBase (Dwarf)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFGeology Expansion (Dwarf)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFFMount Vapius Expansion (Dwarf)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFThe Geology Mod (Clint &amp; Dwarf)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFNature's Bounty\u00A0(Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFChocobo Valley (Marnie)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFDistant Lands (Krobus)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFLunna Astray (Krobus)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFUnique Fish Additions (Willy)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFPhoenix Expansion (Marnie)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFPokemon Fish (Willy)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFPokemon Berry Bushes (Pierre)\n<br />\n<br />   \uFEFFFish of Teyvat (Willy)\n<br />\n<br />[color=#9900ff][size=4]Special Thanks to all the Mod Creators who made these amazing mods and especially\u00A0SlayerDharok for the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5382]Item Bags Mod[/url][/size][/color]",
